---
// src/components/Footer.astro
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#2c4a3e] text-[#faf7f2] mt-20 selection:bg-[#3d6354]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 md:gap-8 border-b border-[#faf7f2]/10">
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-wide">papallona<span class="text-[#e2b29f]">.</span></h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#c5d6cf] font-light max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
        Un rincón acogedor en Castellón diseñado para pausar el ritmo diario, explorar tu creatividad y conectar contigo mismo a través de talleres conscientes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#e2b29f]">Explora</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#c5d6cf] font-light">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Inicio</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#espacio" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">El Espacio</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#talleres" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Próximos Talleres</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Ubicación y Contacto</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#e2b29f]">Síguenos</h4>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#c5d6cf] font-light mb-3">Asómate a nuestro día a día y entérate de las novedades.</p>
      <div class="flex space-x-4">
        <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#faf7f2]/5 hover:bg-[#faf7f2]/10 text-[#faf7f2] transition-colors" aria-label="Instagram">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.827 6.175A2.31 2.31 0 0 1 8.686 5.5h6.628c1.006 0 1.852.682 2.062 1.675l1.38 6.558a2.31 2.31 0 0 1-2.062 2.767H7.31a2.31 2.31 0 0 1-2.062-2.767l1.38-6.558Z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11.25a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://facebook.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#faf7f2]/5 hover:bg-[#faf7f2]/10 text-[#faf7f2] transition-colors" aria-label="Facebook">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10S2 6.477 2 12c0 4.991 3.657 9.128 8.438 9.879V14.89h-2.54V12h2.54V9.797c0-2.506 1.492-3.89 3.777-3.89 1.094 0 2.238.195 2.238.195v2.46h-1.26c-1.243 0-1.63.771-1.63 1.562V12h2.773l-.443 2.89h-2.33v6.988C18.343 21.128 22 16.991 22 12z"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center text-xs text-[#c5d6cf]/70 font-light space-y-2 sm:space-y-0">
    <p>&copy; {currentYear} Papallona. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    <p>Diseñado con mimo en Castellón.</p>
  </div>
</footer>